```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    participant SCH as Scheduler
    participant POL as Proactive Policy
    participant DB as User and Conversation Store
    participant SEL as Topic Selector
    participant RT as Agent Runtime
    participant LLM as Companion Model
    participant OUT as Delivery Service
    participant U as User

    SCH->>POL: User may be eligible for outreach
    POL->>DB: Check consent, last activity and quiet hours
    DB-->>POL: User state and communication history

    alt Not eligible
        POL-->>SCH: Do nothing
    else Eligible
        POL->>SEL: Find a meaningful reason to talk
        SEL->>DB: Retrieve unfinished threads and relevant memories
        DB-->>SEL: Ranked conversation candidates
        SEL-->>POL: Topic, reason and confidence
        POL->>RT: Create proactive agent turn
        RT->>LLM: Generate personalized opening
        LLM-->>RT: Candidate message
        RT->>OUT: Deliver through WebSocket or push
        OUT-->>U: Agent initiates conversation
    end
```